DECODE_THROUGHPUT_STAGE name=intra_pred status=measured cycles_per_mb=0.000 method=combinational — DC Intra_4x4 prediction is pred=128 constant note=Zero additional clock cycles. Intra prediction is currently DC-only (pred=128), computed combinationally inside h264_recon4x4. The parse_cavlc time already covers the residual decode; intra adds no pipeline latency.
