=== HOST residual csum goldens (locked unit) ===
  algo:        residual_csum = XOR sat_s8(coeff[0..15])  as uint8
  coeff_scan:  -24 4 4 0 -4 0 -1 0 0 -1 1 0 1 0 0 0
  res_dc:      -24  (u8=0xe8)  = sat8(coeff[0])
  res_csum:    20  (u8=0x14)  = XOR sat8 full-16
  compute:     residual_csum8(gold) = 0x14 (20)
  anti-golden: arith sum sat8 = -20 → u8 0xec  (DO NOT USE)
  status map (post-3.3l-1 pack):
    raw[12]     residual_dc      status[103:96]   expect 0xe8 (-24)
    raw[13]     residual_csum8   status[111:104]  expect 0x14 (20)
