    raw[15]     recon_dbg flags status[127:120]  P3 RCA; AR may mask bits [2:1]
  hard gate:    res_dc=-24 AND res_csum=20 (raw[13]=0x14)
  soft-skip:    test_f3_residual EXIT=0 on csum miss is NOT hard PASS
